WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.060
Oh, gosh, I can do one in about 10 or 15 minutes max.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.900
I mean, it's that easy. It's just quick and easy.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.900
So your annotated maps are incredible.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.520
They're very easy to use, user-friendly, and they're quick.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.800
But now that you have the tool where we can go in and just click in there

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:25.640
and just add what we need or delete or make some changes,
it is seamless and very easy.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.980
And I've really enjoyed that tool.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.600
And then I can follow the progress.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:37.520
For me, I've got my week's worth of work I want to get done that week,

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.280
and it helps me keep track of that.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:45.460
And as we do it, I can close it out as construction complete, needing splicing,

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:49.680
and then I'll assign a splicer for that, so it drops in their queue,

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.680
but I'm still able to monitor at the same time.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:58.400
So I know it's a great tool. It's very clean, very easy, user-friendly.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.480
Everybody should take a look at it, in my personal opinion.
